<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: #1f2933; line-height: 1.5">
  <p>Buongiorno,</p>

  <p>ti inviamo il preventivo {{quoteNumber}} ({{quoteName}}).</p>

  <p>Puoi consultare, accettare o rifiutare il preventivo:</p>

  <p style="margin: 20px 0">
    <a
      href="{{acceptanceUrl}}"
      style="
        background-color: #0176d3;
        border-radius: 4px;
        color: #ffffff;
        display: inline-block;
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        font-size: 14px;
        font-weight: 700;
        line-height: 40px;
        min-width: 120px;
        padding: 0 18px;
        text-align: center;
        text-decoration: none;
      "
      >Apri il preventivo</a
    >
  </p>

  <p>Grazie,<br />Il team Pienissimo</p>
</div>
